# pointer authentication: the codes would sit in bits iOS code masks as address bits (libobjc's isa mask keeps
# bits 3..42; newfs_apfs died in objc's map_images at the first phone boot). The kernel signs nothing for user
# space and every task thread runs with its keys off. oneios-user-pac=0|1 forces it.
0027-user-pac-off-narrow-host.patch
